{"type": "info", "prompt": "Solana vs Ethereum in 2026: speed, fees, users and TVL", "source": {"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root {\n  --bg: #09090b;\n  --card: #121216;\n  --card-border: #27272a;\n  --ink: #fafafa;\n  --muted: #a1a1aa;\n  --sol: #14f195;\n  --eth: #627eea;\n  --sol-bg: rgba(20, 241, 149, 0.08);\n  --eth-bg: rgba(98, 126, 234, 0.08);\n}\n\nhtml, body {\n  margin: 0;\n  width: 1080px;\n  height: 1350px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--ink);\n  font-family: 'Outfit', system-ui, sans-serif;\n}\n\nmain {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  width: 1080px;\n  height: 1350px;\n  padding: 64px 72px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\nheader {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.kicker {\n  font-family: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--sol);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 78px;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  margin: 0;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  max-width: 900px;\n}\n\nh1 span {\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\n/* Hero Split Stats */\n.hero-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n\n.hero-card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);\n  border-radius: 28px;\n  padding: 32px 36px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.hero-card.sol {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20, 241, 149, 0.06) 0%, var(--card) 60%);\n  border-color: rgba(20, 241, 149, 0.3);\n}\n\n.hero-card.eth {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(98, 126, 234, 0.06) 0%, var(--card) 60%);\n  border-color: rgba(98, 126, 234, 0.3);\n}\n\n.badge {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  font-family: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.sol-badge { color: var(--sol); }\n.eth-badge { color: var(--eth); }\n\n.stat-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.big-num {\n  font-family: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 84px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n}\n\n.stat-label {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-align: right;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n.sub-metrics {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 24px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);\n  padding-top: 16px;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n.sub-metric div:first-child {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\n.sub-metric div:last-child {\n  font-size: 26px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n/* Comparison Section */\n.section-title {\n  font-family: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.comparison-box {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);\n  border-radius: 28px;\n  padding: 36px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 28px;\n}\n\n.comparison-row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr 140px;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n\n.metric-name {\n  font-size: 26px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.bars-group {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.bar-track {\n  height: 18px;\n  background: #1f1f23;\n  border-radius: 9px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.bar-fill {\n  height: 100%;\n  border-radius: 9px;\n}\n\n.bar-fill.sol { background: var(--sol); }\n.bar-fill.eth { background: var(--eth); }\n\n.values-group {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  text-align: right;\n  font-family: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.val-sol { color: var(--sol); font-size: 24px; }\n.val-eth { color: var(--muted); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; }\n\n/* Architectural Insight Cards */\n.insights-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n\n.insight-card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  padding: 30px 32px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.insight-card h3 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n\n.insight-card p {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\nfooter {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);\n  padding-top: 20px;\n}\n\nfooter strong {\n  color: var(--ink);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"kicker\">Network Benchmark &bull; 2026 Forecast</div>\n    <h1>Solana vs. Ethereum <span>L1 Performance</span></h1>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Hero Split Stats: TVL & Users -->\n  <div class=\"hero-grid\">\n    <div class=\"hero-card sol\">\n      <div class=\"badge sol-badge\">\n        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg>\n        Solana Ecosystem\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-row\">\n        <div class=\"big-num\" style=\"color: var(--sol);\">$14.2B</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">Total Value<br>Locked (TVL)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sub-metrics\">\n        <div class=\"sub-metric\">\n          <div>Active Users</div>\n          <div>~7.8M DAU</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sub-metric\">\n          <div>Consensus Model</div>\n          <div>Proof of History</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-card eth\">\n      <div class=\"badge eth-badge\">\n        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg>\n        Ethereum + L2s\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-row\">\n        <div class=\"big-num\" style=\"color: var(--eth);\">$52.8B</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">Total Value<br>Locked (TVL)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sub-metrics\">\n        <div class=\"sub-metric\">\n          <div>Active Users</div>\n          <div>~4.5M DAU</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sub-metric\">\n          <div>Consensus Model</div>\n          <div>Proof of Stake</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Performance & Economics Comparison -->\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"section-title\">Speed &amp; Transaction Economics</div>\n    <div class=\"comparison-box\">\n      \n      <!-- Speed Row (Solana 0.4s vs Ethereum 12s -> ratio 0.4 / 12 = 3.3%) -->\n      <div class=\"comparison-row\">\n        <div class=\"metric-name\">Finality Time</div>\n        <div class=\"bars-group\">\n          <div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-fill sol\" style=\"width: 3.3%;\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-fill eth\" style=\"width: 100%;\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"values-group\">\n          <span class=\"val-sol\">0.4 sec</span>\n          <span class=\"val-eth\">12.0 sec (L1)</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Fees Row (Solana $0.0005 vs Ethereum $0.02 -> ratio 0.0005 / 0.02 = 2.5%) -->\n      <div class=\"comparison-row\">\n        <div class=\"metric-name\">Avg. Transfer Fee</div>\n        <div class=\"bars-group\">\n          <div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-fill sol\" style=\"width: 2.5%;\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-fill eth\" style=\"width: 100%;\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"values-group\">\n          <span class=\"val-sol\">$0.0005</span>\n          <span class=\"val-eth\">$0.02 (L2 avg)</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Key Architectural Takeaways -->\n  <div class=\"insights-grid\">\n    <div class=\"insight-card\">\n      <h3>Monolithic High-Throughput</h3>\n      <p>Solana prioritizes global state synchronization, delivering sub-second finality and ultra-low transaction costs natively.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"insight-card\">\n      <h3>Modular Security Layer</h3>\n      <p>Ethereum acts as the ultimate settlement layer, scaling execution horizontally via rollups while preserving deep liquidity.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer>\n    <div>Sources: <strong>TokenTerminal, L2Beat, On-Chain Metrics</strong></div>\n    <div>Updated Q1 2026</div>\n  </footer>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>", "size": [1080, 1350], "hero": null}, "edits": [], "created": 1792724081.5708358}